<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/pizzabfo.owl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/pizzabfo.owl> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/pizzabfo/1.0.0> .
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/pizzabfo.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A pizza ontology aligned to BFO 2020 - the BFO that NFDIcore 3.0.5 builds on - and made from BFO and NFDIcore design patterns. It holds no individuals: its instance data is a separate knowledge graph built from ROBOT templates."@en .
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/pizzabfo.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
