<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "206-BFO" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has realization"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "realized in"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "b has realization c =Def c realizes b"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "As for realizes"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has realization"@en .
# 
# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "059-BFO" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "realizes"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "(Elucidation) realizes is a relation between a process b and realizable entity c such that c inheres in some d & for all t, if b has participant d then c exists & the type instantiated by b is correlated with the type instantiated by c"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A balding process realizes a disposition to go bald; a studying process realizes a student role; a process of pumping blood realizes the pumping function of a heart"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "realizes"@en .
